# A murloc warrior in the Wrathtail's pens (mod-murloc-naga's story, chapter 1), after its start was
# checked: the Elder's first quest, handed in to Murlorga; her /wave quest done by waving at the four
# slaves; Overseer Kezzith's count (a place to stand); the warrior trainer's lessons in the pens; and
# Auberdine's quests closed to it while its story isn't done (the gate).
# Written with the story's names; tools/build_data.py writes warcraft/server/murloc_naga_murloc.steps
# with their ids.
wait 3
talk {ch1:elder}
has quest {ch1:ch1_brand}:
expect-not quest 954:
accept {ch1:elder} {ch1:ch1_brand}
wait 6
talk {ch1:murlorga}
reward {ch1:murlorga} {ch1:ch1_brand}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_brand}
talk {ch1:murlorga}
expect quest {ch1:ch1_hello}:
accept {ch1:murlorga} {ch1:ch1_hello}
emote {ch1:gurp} 101
emote {ch1:nubbin} 101
emote {ch1:mrrlo} 101
emote {ch1:squirt} 101
expect complete {ch1:ch1_hello}
talk {ch1:murlorga}
reward {ch1:murlorga} {ch1:ch1_hello}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_hello}
talk {ch1:kezzith}
expect quest {ch1:ch1_count}:
accept {ch1:kezzith} {ch1:ch1_count}
go 1 4089.0 1078.0 {z:ch1:your_mark}
wait 3
expect complete {ch1:ch1_count}
talk {ch1:kezzith}
reward {ch1:kezzith} {ch1:ch1_count}
expect rewarded {ch1:ch1_count}
# The tribe's warrior trainer teaches (the game's warrior trainer's list).
talk {ch1:brrgmrk}
select-nth {ch1:brrgmrk} 0
expect trainer type 0
# Auberdine's quests aren't a murloc's while its story isn't done (Thundris Windweaver's).
go 1 6581.0 492.0 8.3
talk 3649
expect-not quest 954:
